## WY Biohazard Containment Unit

cmu-wybio-name-leader = WY Containment Team Leader
cmu-wybio-description-leader = Lead a PMC Dispatch biohazard containment unit. Find the contamination, seal it off and burn it out.
cmu-wybio-prefix-leader = BCU. TL.
cmu-wybio-name-sterilizer = WY Sterilisation Specialist
cmu-wybio-description-sterilizer = A PMC Dispatch sterilisation specialist with an M240 incinerator. Whatever the site couldn't contain, you burn.
cmu-wybio-prefix-sterilizer = BCU. SPW.
cmu-wybio-name-technician = WY Containment Technician
cmu-wybio-description-technician = A PMC Dispatch containment technician. Seal off the area, check it's clean, and breach whatever needs breaching.
cmu-wybio-prefix-technician = BCU. TEC.
cmu-wybio-name-medic = WY Containment Medic
cmu-wybio-description-medic = A PMC Dispatch medical specialist. Keep the unit alive and uncontaminated, and screen anyone who comes out of the zone.
cmu-wybio-prefix-medic = BCU. SPM.
cmu-wybio-supervisors-leader = The containment team leader
cmu-wybio-greeting = You are a Weyland-Yutani biohazard containment contractor, sent in by PMC Dispatch because a Company site has a contamination it can't hold. Seal the area, destroy the hazard, and keep anyone from carrying it out. Report to the senior employee on site.
cmu-wybio-rules = You are a WY biohazard containment contractor. Your job is to destroy the hazard, not the site. Warn people before you burn an area and don't torch those who can be screened and cleared.

## WY Internal Affairs Team

cmu-wyia-name-senior = WY Internal Affairs Senior Auditor
cmu-wyia-description-senior = Lead an audit from the Directorate's Office of Internal Affairs. Go through the site's records, accounts and conduct, and report what you find to head office.
cmu-wyia-prefix-senior = IA. Sr. Aud.
cmu-wyia-name-auditor = WY Internal Affairs Auditor
cmu-wyia-description-auditor = An auditor from the Office of Internal Affairs. Check the books, interview the staff and find what doesn't add up.
cmu-wyia-prefix-auditor = IA. Aud.
cmu-wyia-name-pps = WY Internal Affairs Protection Specialist
cmu-wyia-description-pps = Lead the Personal Protection detail assigned to an Internal Affairs audit. Keep the auditors safe wherever the audit takes them.
cmu-wyia-prefix-pps = PPS.
cmu-wyia-name-ppo = WY Internal Affairs Protection Officer
cmu-wyia-description-ppo = A Personal Protection Officer assigned to an Internal Affairs audit. Stay with the auditors, and make sure the people they want to talk to stay put.
cmu-wyia-supervisors-senior = The Internal Affairs Senior Auditor
cmu-wyia-supervisors-pps = The Internal Affairs Protection Specialist
cmu-wyia-greeting = You are with the Weyland-Yutani Office of Internal Affairs, sent to audit a Company site. Examine its records, accounts and staff conduct. Staff found in breach of Company policy may be relieved of duty and held for review. Report your findings to head office.
cmu-wyia-rules = You are a WY Internal Affairs auditor or protection officer. You investigate. You are not an execution squad. Any staff member you relieve of duty is detained, not harmed, unless they resist with force.

## WY Asset Recovery Team

cmu-wyrecovery-name-leader = WY Asset Recovery Team Leader
cmu-wyrecovery-description-leader = Lead a PMC Dispatch asset recovery team. Find what the Company lost, whether data, a specimen or a person, and bring it home.
cmu-wyrecovery-prefix-leader = ART. TL.
cmu-wyrecovery-name-operator = WY Asset Recovery Operator
cmu-wyrecovery-description-operator = A PMC Dispatch recovery operator. Secure the asset and anyone carrying it, and get it back to the shuttle.
cmu-wyrecovery-prefix-operator = ART. OPR.
cmu-wyrecovery-name-technician = WY Retrieval Technician
cmu-wyrecovery-description-technician = A PMC Dispatch retrieval technician with the capture shotgun. Sedate the specimen, drag it into the crate and lock it.
cmu-wyrecovery-prefix-technician = ART. TEC.
cmu-wyrecovery-name-medic = WY Asset Recovery Medic
cmu-wyrecovery-description-medic = A PMC Dispatch medical specialist. Keep the team, and any human asset, alive for the trip home.
cmu-wyrecovery-prefix-medic = ART. SPM.
cmu-wyrecovery-supervisors-leader = The asset recovery team leader
cmu-wyrecovery-greeting = You are a Weyland-Yutani asset recovery contractor, sent in by PMC Dispatch to bring back something the Company has lost: data, a specimen or a person. You are paid on what you bring home. Your shuttle carries a specimen crate.
cmu-wyrecovery-rules = You are a WY asset recovery contractor. Recover the asset. A dead asset is worth nothing, and neither is a team that starts a war over it.
